<h1>Terms of Service — Moja Wioska</h1>

<p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 11 November 2026</p>

<h2>1. General provisions</h2>

<p>These Terms of Service (hereinafter: "Terms") govern the use of the "Moja Wioska" mobile application (hereinafter: "App"), available for Android devices.</p>

<p>The App is designed for managing daily household activities, including tasks, recipes, shopping lists, weather, chat, notebook, quizzes and timers.</p>

<p>By using the App you accept these Terms.</p>

<h2>2. Definitions</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>User</strong> — a person who has downloaded the App and created an account.</li>
  <li><strong>Account</strong> — the User's individual profile in the App, created with an email address and password or via Google Sign-in.</li>
  <li><strong>User Content</strong> — all data entered by the User into the App, including tasks, recipes, shopping lists, notes, chat messages and quizzes.</li>
  <li><strong>AI</strong> — artificial intelligence features built into the App that help the User automate tasks.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Registration and account</h2>

<ol>
  <li>Registration requires an email address, a password and gender (for outfit recommendations).</li>
  <li>Users may also register using a Google account.</li>
  <li>The email address must be verified after registration.</li>
  <li>The User is responsible for keeping their password and account secure.</li>
  <li>One account may be used on multiple devices.</li>
</ol>

<h2>4. App features</h2>

<h3>4.1 Tasks</h3>
<p>The tasks module lets you create, edit and mark tasks as complete. AI automatically recognises entities in task text, such as phone numbers, dates, addresses, links, email addresses and bank account numbers, enabling quick actions (call, add to calendar, navigate, copy).</p>

<h3>4.2 Weather and outfit recommendations</h3>
<p>The weather module shows the current forecast based on the device's location. AI generates outfit recommendations tailored to the temperature, the User's gender and their rating history. The algorithm learns the User's preferences with every rating.</p>

<h3>4.3 Chat</h3>
<p>The chat module enables real-time messaging. Users can create public and private rooms, invite and manage members. Selected chat text can be saved to the notebook.</p>

<h3>4.4 Recipes</h3>
<p>The recipes module lets you add recipes manually, by pasting a link, typing text or asking AI to generate one. AI formats ingredients, portions and preparation steps. Recipes can be imported from photos and PDF files (OCR). AI may improve recipes.</p>

<h3>4.5 Shopping list</h3>
<p>The shopping list module lets you create and share shopping lists. Products can be added via text, photos or files. AI automatically categorises products.</p>

<h3>4.6 Quiz</h3>
<p>The quiz module lets AI generate educational quizzes on any topic. The User chooses the topic and the number of questions.</p>

<h3>4.7 Notebook</h3>
<p>The notebook module offers a rich text editor (Tiptap) with hierarchical pages and sub-pages. It supports text formatting, links, lists and word count. Notes can be imported from photos and PDF files.</p>

<h3>4.8 Timer</h3>
<p>The timer module offers three visual modes: digital countdown, sand timer and water timer. Durations range from 15 seconds to 2 hours, with a push notification at the end.</p>

<h2>5. AI features</h2>

<ol>
  <li>AI in the App is an assistive tool — results generated by AI may contain inaccuracies.</li>
  <li>The User is responsible for verifying AI-generated content before acting on it.</li>
  <li>AI processes User data solely to fulfil the requested function (e.g. formatting a recipe, generating a quiz).</li>
  <li>Files uploaded to the document import feature (photos, PDFs) are not stored after they have been read — the maximum file size is 10 MB.</li>
</ol>

<h2>6. Document import</h2>

<ol>
  <li>The App allows importing content from photos and PDF files using OCR technology.</li>
  <li>Import is available in the recipes, shopping list and notebook modules.</li>
  <li>An uploaded file is processed once and is not saved on the server after reading.</li>
  <li>The maximum upload file size is 10 MB.</li>
</ol>

<h2>7. Offline mode</h2>

<p>The App supports offline mode through a local database (IndexedDB). Data is synced with the server once an internet connection is restored.</p>

<h2>8. Push notifications</h2>

<p>The App may send push notifications for timers, chat messages and other events. Users can disable notifications in their device settings.</p>

